   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Portal Reveal\n\nA landing page tears open from the centre in a glowing, colour-cycling portal and the dark theme of the same page is revealed behind it, with chromatic aberration and edge distortion along the rim. WebGL shader over two built-in pages (light and dark).\n\nCategory: transitions. Length: 10 s. WebGL: yes.\n\nUse when:\n- A light-to-dark theme reveal for a product or app: the page tears open and the dark UI appears inside the portal.\n- Any before/after reveal that should feel like a glowing rift.\n\nAvoid when:\n- You need to reveal your own scenes: the block plays between its two built-in pages; copy the shader and feed it your two frames as textures.\n- A quiet, minimal cut.\n\nVariables:\n- brand (string): Brand name, default \"Lumen\"\n- title (string): Headline, default \"Ship faster|See it live\"\n- subtitle (string): Subtitle, default \"Ship faster with a platform that handles the hard parts. Analytics, infrastructure, and developer tools, all in one place.\"\n- button (string): Button, default \"Get started\"\n- nav (string): Menu, default \"Product, Pricing, Docs, Sign In\"\n- cards (string): Cards, default \"Lightning Fast | Sub-millisecond response times with edge deployment across 40+ regions worldwide.; Secure by Default | End-to-end encryption and role-based access out of the box.; Plug and Play | 200+ integrations. Connect your existing stack in minutes, not weeks.; Real-time Insights | Live dashboards, anomaly detection and recommendations.\"\n- accent (color): Accent, default \"#2563eb\"\n- accent2 (color): Accent 2, default \"#60a5fa\"\n- glow (color): Portal glow colour, default \"#2563eb\"\n- glow2 (color): Portal glow colour 2, default \"#4a90ff\"\n- resolution (number, 0.25-1): Resolution, default 0.75\n\nSource: heygen-com/hyperframes. Licence: Apache-2.0. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
